#: text_calendar.cpp:838
msgid "Do you still want to delegate this task?"
msgstr "Wullt Du disse Opgaav liekers afgeven?"

#. +> trunk stable
#: text_calendar.cpp:840
msgid "Do you still want to delegate this invitation?"
msgstr "Wullt Du disse Inladen liekers afgeven?"

#. +> trunk stable
#: text_calendar.cpp:844
msgid "Do you still want to forward this task?"
msgstr "Wullt Du disse Opgaav liekers wiederledden?"

