msgstr "Wullt Du disse Inladen liekers binnen Dien Kalenner opteken?"

#. +> trunk stable
#: text_calendar.cpp:864
msgid "Do you really want to cancel this task?"
msgstr "Wullt Du disse Opgaav redig torüchnehmen?"

#. +> trunk stable
#: text_calendar.cpp:866
msgid "Do you really want to cancel this invitation?"
msgstr "Wullt Du disse Inladen redig torüchnehmen?"

